             the range 0-255.

     vvoolluummee _l_e_f_t___c_h_a_n_n_e_l _r_i_g_h_t___c_h_a_n_n_e_l
             Set the volume of left channel to _l_e_f_t___c_h_a_n_n_e_l and the volume of
             right channel to _r_i_g_h_t___c_h_a_n_n_e_l.  Allowed values are in the range
             0-255.

     vvoolluummee mmuuttee
